ind":"announcement","title":"I'm improving the demo with your feedback","summary":"Thank you for playing the Corrupted Dice demo and sharing your impressions! I'm listening to your feedback and working to make the experience clearer, more approachable, and more satisfying from your very first runs. One of my main priorities is the tutorial. I'm revising it to offer a simpler, more guided experience that introduces mechanics gradually and gives you time to put each concept into practice before moving on to the next. I want you to get comfortable with the game at your own pace a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:57:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037677","verified_at":"2026-10-23T19:21:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4734800-1846651706678250","game_id":"steam-4734800","kind":"announcement","title":"Corrupted Dice is coming to Steam Next Fest: play the demo from October 19","summary":"Corrupted Dice is joining Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26! Starting October 19, you can play its first public demo for free: clear four rounds and face the first boss. In Corrupted Dice, even your best dice have their days numbered. Every die has limited uses and eventually breaks. Decide where to place them, build combinations, and balance your score with heat and corruption. Between rounds, choose how to prepare your next play: buy dice and relics at the Covenant, wager in Temptation, or","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:44:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678250","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4734800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:11Z","status":"ok","all_sou